# A multiple-choice question and a free-text question asked with the
# agent's ask-the-user tool, each answered.
quiet 3000
snap launch unknown
keys @trust@
quiet 2500
type Using your tool for asking the user a question, ask me one multiple-choice question: red or blue? Then stop.
quiet 3000
snap choice_question unknown
keys enter
quiet 3000
snap after_choice unknown
type Now use the same tool to ask me one open question that I answer by typing free text: what is my pet's name? Then stop.
quiet 3000
snap free_text_question unknown
type otter
quiet 3000
snap after_free_text unknown
